# A4H Presentations — Test (v3)

Test version of the A4H Bhajan Clubbing 2026 presentations page.

- **Test URL:** https://americans4hindus-mi.github.io/bhajanclubbing/presentations-test/
- **Production URL:** https://americans4hindus-mi.github.io/bhajanclubbing/presentations/
- **Purpose:** Test video selection, automatic scrolling, playback, and mobile display before release.
- **Data:** Reads the live `Event Presentations` Google Sheet; changes to that sheet affect both test and production.

Upload `index.html` and `README.md` into `bhajanclubbing/presentations-test/`. Do not replace the production page until testing is approved.
